WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:06.230
As you can see, our family's home is a temple.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:13.570
Not much has changed recently,

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:20.240
but overall, it's my job to do the housework.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.380
Rea, don't go outside for too long.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.590
Today's weather is pretty good.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.130
I'm sorry.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.300
Mero-chan.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.680
Eh...?

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.390
What's up with her?

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.440
Hey, come inside.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.690
Okay.

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:59.580
By the way, you must be worried about what would happen to Nii and Rea-dono next.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.660
This time, I'd like you to take a break,

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:07.210
and listen to my, Furuya Mero's, story.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.210
Hey, Mero.

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:11.460
Ah?

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.430
I'm going out soon.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:51.020
Will you be back late today?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:54.690
Yeah, since I'm going to three parishioners' houses,

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.820
I'll be having dinner out.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.320
Roger.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:02.530
Also, Chihiro is with Rea-chan, and wouldn't need anything either.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:04.120
I see.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:07.220
That Chihiro...

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:12.420
At first I was worried about him saying he would look after her,

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.380
but he's doing better than we thought, right?

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.880
That Nii...

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:21.380
He was lazy,and always relied on you.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:23.640
Yeah.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:26.890
Always going on about how he has to protect her...

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.850
He's becoming more reliable.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:32.440
Huh?

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:33.810
Hey, Mero.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.060
Huh?

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:39.150
It makes no sense to sweep the same place over and over, does it?

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.110
Anyway, I'm going.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.680
That's what my father said,

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:14.850
and this might be the first time I'm seeing my brother like that...

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:24.110
This is what he looks like when he's working hard for someone else...

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.620
See, isn't it amazing?

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:41.590
"The number of people who have seen zombies is rapidly increasing around the world."

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:45.300
"What will happen to humankind now?!" it says.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.430
My classmate,

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:48.720
Shinoda Ichie.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.720
There are no such things as zombies.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.730
This is Yasaka Miko.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.400
If they really existed,

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:01.230
the news and the papers would have picked up on them.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.650
Miko, you're being deceived.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:11.620
The government is censoring the information!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.580
It's also been written about on the Net.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.880
But, if the number of zombies were increasing,

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.630
we would see them around.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:25.670
That's right!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:26.550
Eh?

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.760
There's a zombie nearby, and it's very close to you!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.850
Mero-chan?

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.140
No, that's too close.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.650
That's not it.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.650
Now there's something that's really bothering me.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:42.400
Eh?

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.400
The fine arts teacher, Yamanouchi.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.660
Yamanouchi-sensei?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.990
Yes, Yamanouchi.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.710
A while ago, I realised that I'd left something in the fine arts room,

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:04.670
and went to get it.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:11.300
It was strange that someone was there at a time like that.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.310
Then...

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:17.270
Here... Eat! Good boy!

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.080
Delicious?

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:20.480
Want seconds?

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:25.610
She was holding a bloody piece of meat with her bare hands.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.030
Then she let something eat it.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.660
However, not only that...

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:49.430
Speaking of Yamanouchi-sensei, I also...

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:54.430
She always drives to work, but...

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.520
No matter how I see it, it should be a living animal.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.720
Putting aside whether it's a zombie or not,

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:08.400
it's something that makes me shiver.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.150
Oh, by the way...

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:15.780
Don't you think Yamanouchi-sensei is acting strange lately?

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:21.170
I wonder what's going on...

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.540
Okay, I understand.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.050
Yamanouchi does not belong in this world!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.010
Really?

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.550
She's a zombie.

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:35.390
Then what about the animal that was being fed?

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:38.890
It could be the zombie's child, or its underling...

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:42.390
However, no matter how we look at it, she's obviously a zombie.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.900
Okay,

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:48.400
in that case, let's find evidence that proves Yamanouchi is a zombie.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.110
The three of us?

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.030
Yes, that's right.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:56.530
We will discover the truth about
zombies as the Zombie Scoop Hunters.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.500
Really?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.910
Who knows...

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.060
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:24.560
I will let you eat a lot, okay?

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.320
Here, eat as much as you want today.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.950
Actually, I'm a bit scared.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.370
What are you talking about?

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:40.330
We came here to finally have a chance to see a real zombie.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:47.750
It's about to come out.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:53.380
Here...

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.240
Is this crocodile Sensei's pet?

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.360
Yes, he is.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.360
Isn't he cute?

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.370
Yeah...

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:22.700
But Sensei, why do you take the crocodile to school?

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.290
I'm worried.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:28.920
Occasionally you hear about a pet crocodile escaping on the news.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.380
And so...

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.880
But to be honest,

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:37.380
I don't want to be separated from him, not even for a moment.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:42.010
So you put it inside a bag and bring it to the fine arts room?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.390
Yes.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:50.650
Feeding him after school is the most relaxing time of my whole day.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:52.150
I see.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.530
He really loves meat a lot.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:01.870
A-Also, Sensei, you've got thinner recently.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.910
Did something happen?

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.040
Oh, about that.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:13.920
When I was preparing his meal, the pig liver looked so delicious that I thoughtlessly ate some of it with him.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.800
It damaged my stomach.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:24.470
I thought pig liver would be similar to sashimi, but raw meat is not something that should be eaten carelessly.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:27.890
Therefore, recently my stomach has been giving me a hard time.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.110
Excuse me.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:45.410
Ichie-chan, is there any zombie information today?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.200
Not much.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.790
Really?

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:54.340
Actually, I found something interesting.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.470
You know how my nose is very sensitive, right?

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.050
Is it?

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:03.300
So, on my way home yesterday,

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:08.730
there was a very strange smell coming from somewhere.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.810
Oh?

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:12.100
How should I put it...

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.480
It smelt like a rotten corpse.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:18.070
Wait a minute.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:22.570
Miko, have you smelt a rotten corpse before?

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.700
Of course I haven't.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:26.580
I'm only basing it off my imagination.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:30.580
Where does your imagination come from, and where is it going?!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:33.710
Let's continue listening to what happened after that.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:34.590
Okay.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:40.720
As I walked towards the source of the smell, I came to a certain house.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:50.430
So, I peeked inside, and then...

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:54.810
Hey, hey.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:57.900
This story has started to get interesting!

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.440
Then what happened?

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.780
Of course I continued peeking inside...

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.490
Hey, you...

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.370
Is there something you want from my house?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.910
Please help me!

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:21.470
I feel sick, honestly!

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:27.220
The smell of a box of bones from the rubbish and soup made you think there were zombies here, huh?

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:30.720
I suppose we should be careful about the smell.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.230
Uh, what is this really about...?

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:39.360
My husband is going to quit his job and we're going to start a ramen shop.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:43.170
Therefore, in order to make our special soup,

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:46.240
we are testing different recipes day and night.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.200
Here.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.620
This must be some kind of destiny.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.710
Please try it.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:56.330
Even though it stinks, it'll definitely be delicious.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.590
Come on, don't hold back.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.900
Once I started eating, I couldn't stop.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:23.400
From what you're telling us, I assume the
soup was made using the tonkotsu system.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.660
It's the first time I've ever eaten something like this.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.000
Hey, Miko.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.420
In the end, what kind of story are you telling us?

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:40.290
The story of that delicious ramen...

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.300
Wasn't it supposed to be about zombies?

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:46.300
If a zombie had that ramen as well, they would also say it's delicious.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.300
What kind of comparison is that?!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.060
As expected, zombies are pretty hard to find.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:14:00.270
But some day, I will definitely find one!

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.610
But in reality, what is it?

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.860
Mero-chan, what do you think?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:11.660
To begin with, there's a zombie staying in our house.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:12.700
What?

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:13.790
Eh?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.660
Really?!

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.870
What about it?

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.790
For real?!

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.540
Show me later.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:23.460
Okay.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.670
However, she might not be at home right now.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.840
If so, take some photos as evidence.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.760
Then let's post them to the Monthly Muoh.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:34.930
That's an invasion of privacy...

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:37.060
Like zombies have privacy?!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.770
No, our home has privacy, because if it didn't,

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:44.070
it would affect our temple's reputation and business.

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.360
Wait, you just said the zombie went out.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.450
Is that all right?

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.870
It seems like some moderate exercise is necessary.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:53.810
Hey, hey.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:57.410
Isn't a zombie something that attacks humans and eats their flesh?

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.050
Not at all.

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:00.080
She always eats hydrangea leaves.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.750
I think she's a vegetarian.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.130
Vegetarian...

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:08.630
It seems like her way of living is very
different, compared to a normal zombie.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.520
Instead of being a normal zombie,

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:14.180
she said she would like to be a normal girl.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.350
I don't understand.

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.390
Is she really a zombie?

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:20.190
Nii says so.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:20.850
Nii?!

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:24.020
That's just your weird brother...

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:26.530
"I want to kiss a zombie girl!"

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.490
What is that?!

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:31.110
Isn't it just nonsense?

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.120
Who knows?

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:37.620
I still have things to buy, so I have to go now.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.750
Okay.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:44.880
I thought this might be a chance to make us famous...

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.880
Honestly, that brother of yours...

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:52.130
Can't you tell your mum to teach him better manners?

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.680
Ichie-chan...

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:54.760
What?!

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.140
Mero-chan's family...

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.430
I'm sorry.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:07.520
Oh, you don't have to worry about that.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:17.870
True, our family doesn't have a mother.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:22.460
Before I could understand anything, she was no longer there.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:26.170
Because of that, I don't remember much about my mother.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:47.480
However, I do remember one thing about my mother.

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:51.490
That is...

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:57.620
Oh my, is that a fever?

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.660
This isn't good.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:06.080
Since I'm dead, I can't tell the temperature difference.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:06.830
Hand...

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:13.470
My memory of her cold and bandaged hand...

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.690
Why can't I?

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:34.860
I just came to borrow a zombie DVD, like I usually do.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:37.240
If that's all, just take the DVD and leave.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:41.660
But sometimes I want to watch DVDs together...

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.500
But, today...

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.500
You've been very blunt recently.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:46.120
Huh?

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.370
Whatever, it's fine.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:49.830
Ranko, you're acting strange.

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:52.330
I will not give up so easily.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:52.750
Eh?

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.670
Nothing.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:58.390
When I talk with you, I get confused.

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:01.050
Did your brain go rotten, just like a zombie's?

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:02.220
For real?!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.560
What are you happy about?

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.930
Obviously, it was a joke.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.480
I guess it was.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:17.650
Nii offered some strange snacks again.

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:21.700
Honestly, what is he thinking?

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.750
This is fine.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.300
Ah, Mero-chan.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.260
Welcome home.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:45.220
Rea-dono, I'm back.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:48.350
Is there something you want to do in the graveyard?

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.860
Not really, I don't really have anything special to do.

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:56.740
Furuya-kun has a guest with him, so for a little bit...

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.280
I see.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:02.870
I start to worry from time to time...

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:09.120
Am I creating problems for Furuya-kun or other people around me?

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.710
No, it's nothing like that.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.210
I'm sorry for saying something strange.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.800
Mero-chan, what are you...

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:20.340
Ah, cemetery visit?

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.800
I came to visit my mother's grave.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.020
I see.

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:31.140
I've been wondering why I haven't seen your mother.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.650
So this is the reason.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.490
Mero-chan is so great.

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:45.080
You take charge of all the housework at home, don't you?

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:48.750
Well, I have been helping out since I was young.

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:52.120
I was raised in an overprotective family.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:56.340
Therefore I respect you, Mero-chan, as you can do everything by yourself.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:20:02.090
Well, if the men in my family could take care of
things themselves, I wouldn't have as much to do.

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:08.890
That's right.

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:13.100
In that case, from now on, let me help with the housework as well.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.300
Eh?

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:17.440
No, that would be bad.

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:18.530
Why?

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.650
Of course there's nothing bad about it.

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.280
Besides, I want to try doing it anyway.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.870
Okay, Mero-chan?

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:27.160
Please let me do it.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.790
Okay, Mero-chan.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:37.790
Hurray.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:41.800
Hey, what's wrong?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.260
Why are you looking down?

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.970
Your face is all red.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:48.560
Do you have a fever?

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:52.850
It's cold.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:56.230
This isn't good.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.980
Since I am a zombie,

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:00.690
even if I do that, I can't tell the temperature difference.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.450
Mama.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:15.460
Mama?

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.380
No...

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.500
I-It's nothing.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:21.500
Hey, wait.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:25.760
Mero-chan, you forgot your things...

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.770
Rea-dono, I'm very sorry.

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:40.020
There, it's all done.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:41.360
Let's make dinner!

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:47.200
At that time, why did I say that...

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:51.700
However, I definitely felt something...

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:55.160
That's a zombie?

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.080
What a beautiful person.

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:59.670
That's a total lie, isn't it?

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:05.420
Through Rea-dono, I can see traces of my mother.

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:45.230
Mero-chan, why are you feeling sad?

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:46.520
Sanka-san...

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:47.190
Yes?

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:49.740
Read the mood, read the mood.

00:23:53.820 --> 00:23:54.910
O-Okay.

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:56.490
Next time: Sankarea...

00:23:56.490 --> 00:23:59.750
Episode 10: Strong... Affections...

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:01.960
Everyone Mero, Mero...

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:07.990
Mero-chan, are you upset that Ranko-san and I did the preview?

00:24:07.990 --> 00:24:09.710
Sanka-san...!
